  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ugh! They're still fighting back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Skullshatterer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "As long as we can push them back, victory will be ours!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Right now... we have no choice but to fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "These guys... are pretty tough!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Gaah-! Damn, that shield of yours..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Sh-she's the one from the L.G.D...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It's not too late to put down your weapons and surrender..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Unless you want to die in vain right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "You'd expect us to believe you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Liar! Ursus... they've said the same thing before. But they executed those Infected, one by one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "I hid beneath the bodies of the slain, holding my breath, in order to survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "There are no depths to which your kind won't stoop... in order to exterminate us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Aren't you just trying to round us up so you can kill us faster?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Very well. You've made your choice then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "You're not getting through to them, big fella. They won't listen to reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "They can't even distinguish between good and even, Lungmen and Ursus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "In that place... No, in many places..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Only hatred exists between those who are infected and those who are not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "It seems that because of that... all communication has broken down. Even though there's another path in front of our eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "Another path?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "What... could we possibly do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "And what could you accomplish?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Don't waste any more time listening to their lies! Skullshatterer, let's get rid of them together!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Explosions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "He's planning to surround us from multiple directions!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Our flank will collapse if we can't seize the initiative... Prepare to counterattack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Skullshatterer! I'll cover you! Just kill them, and the battle will be over!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Skullshatterer...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "I have to go back... with all of you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "I have to...!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "----------"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We don't have much time left!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Hoshiguma."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Act carefully. Don't show the enemy any signs of weakness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "I won't give them an opening!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Watch out, the enemy is charging forward!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Amiya! Stay away from the enemy...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Th-that's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor... Doctor, what should I do..."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You know what you have to do, Amiya.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But I don't want to..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm sorry, Doctor... I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "A-..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "Amiya...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Why..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Why did you become like this..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Skullshatterer",
          "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
          "text": "Amiya... I guess this was our fate all along."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Amiya! What are you doing? Hurry..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Tsk..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Madam Ch'en? I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "That's enough."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "It's time..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "...to put an end to this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Madam Ch'en..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "There is one thing I must tell you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "From now on, you'd better treat all Infected the same way... ...as your enemies."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Life is unfair."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "If you want to hate someone, then hate me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "L.G.D.! Attack!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
